// File List fire stream (section 6.1)
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix I (KScript and KSWorld), section 6.1 File list, lead-in 'One highlight is this stream definition', PDF page 29 (printed page 28)
// Also printed in: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix II (Making Applications in KSWorld), section 3 Example: The File List, lead-in 'One highlight is this stream definition', PDF page 43 (printed page 42)
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.

fire <- when
          acceptButton.fire
        then
          { dir: selectedShortcut,
           file: nameField.textContents()}

